=== D2 The gateway knows Ticket Service only by name; Docker DNS turns the name into the current IP ===
$ docker compose exec api-gateway printenv TICKET_SERVICE_URL AUTH_SERVICE_URL DEPARTMENT_SERVICE_URL
TICKET_SERVICE_URL=dns:///ticket-service:50051
AUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://auth-service:3002
DEPARTMENT_SERVICE_URL=http://department-service:3001
$ docker compose exec -T api-gateway node -e require('dns').lookup('ticket-service', (e, a) => console.log('ticket-service ->', e ? e.code : a))
ticket-service -> 172.23.0.8
ticket-service container IP: 172.23.0.8

